---
paths: "**/*.py"
---

# Python Standards

- **MANDATORY:** All Python commands MUST run inside a venv
- Create `.venv` if missing, activate before ANY pip/python command
- NEVER run pip/python outside the venv (no global installs)
- Always call `<python-binary>` (e.g. `python3`) — `<why: only python3 exists on this system>`
